<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.graph.relates ~ the bitemporal knowledge graph around one entity

`lares sense relate <entity…>` reads the bitemporal knowledge graph of one plane (`lens=`, default content) around one entity, `as-of=` reading it at a past time. A leading sensorium name (`lares sense <sensorium> <verb>`) addresses any named sensorium; bare, the verb reads `memory`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ relate · as-of

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`relate` params=`entity/harbor ~ the entity's relations`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`as-of` params=`entity/harbor as-of/2026-10-01 ~ its relations as they stood then`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ entity · lens · as-of

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`entity` params=`takes/words needs/required seat/1 as/<entity…> ~ the entity`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lens` params=`takes/plane default/content ~ the plane: content, structure, form, persistence, a named sensorium's own, or crossplane`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`as-of` params=`takes/time ~ read the graph as it stood then`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ rides the daemon's composed caps, the single-owner law; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · verb-error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.graph.relates entity/harbor]] ~ no entity named`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`verb-error` params=`~ an unknown lens, or the plane holds nothing to relate`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ related

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`related` params=`exit/0 ~ the entity's edges`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares sense relate

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares sense relate]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

